<h2 style="margin: 0; font-size: 25px; font-weight: bold; display: flex; align-items: center;"><span style="background: #ffffff; color: #1e3a5f; padding: 8px 14px; border-radius: 8px; font-size: 15px; font-weight: bold; margin-right: 12px;"> UMRAN </span> Author Guidelines</h2>
<div style="margin-top: 8px; font-size: 14px; opacity: .95;"><strong>UMRAN : Journal of Islamic Studies and Social Humanities</strong></div>
</div>
<!-- INTRODUCTION -->
<p style="text-align: justify; font-size: 15px;"><strong>UMRAN : Journal of Islamic Studies and Social Humanities</strong> is a peer-reviewed scientific journal published by <strong>LP2M STAI Al Mannan Kauman Tulungagung</strong>. The journal provides an academic forum for publishing original research in Islamic Studies and Social Humanities. Submitted manuscripts must be original, unpublished, and not under consideration by another journal. Articles may be written in <strong>Bahasa Indonesia</strong> or <strong>English</strong> following the official journal template.</p>
<!-- CONTENT -->
<div style="margin-top: 30px;"><!-- 1 -->
<div style="display: flex; align-items: flex-start; margin-bottom: 20px;">
<div style="min-width: 38px; height: 38px; background: linear-gradient(135deg,#1E3A5F,#4A90E2); border-radius: 50%; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; color: #fff; font-weight: bold; margin-right: 14px;">1</div>
<div><strong style="color: #1e3a5f; font-size: 16px;">Aims &amp; Scope</strong><br>The journal publishes original research articles related to Islamic Studies and Social Humanities, including Qur'anic Studies, Hadith Studies, Islamic Education, Islamic Law, Islamic Thought, History of Islamic Civilization, Sociology of Religion, Anthropology, Communication, Culture, Politics, Economics, Philosophy, Gender Studies, and other relevant interdisciplinary studies.</div>
</div>
<!-- 2 -->
<div style="display: flex; align-items: flex-start; margin-bottom: 20px;">
<div style="min-width: 38px; height: 38px; background: linear-gradient(135deg,#1E3A5F,#4A90E2); border-radius: 50%; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; color: #fff; font-weight: bold; margin-right: 14px;">2</div>
<div><strong style="color: #1e3a5f; font-size: 16px;">Manuscript Structure</strong><br>Articles should include: <strong>Title, Author(s), Affiliation, Email, Abstract, Keywords, Introduction, Method, Results and Discussion, Conclusion, Acknowledgment (optional),</strong> and <strong>References.</strong></div>
</div>
<!-- 3 -->
<div style="display: flex; align-items: flex-start; margin-bottom: 20px;">
<div style="min-width: 38px; height: 38px; background: linear-gradient(135deg,#1E3A5F,#4A90E2); border-radius: 50%; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; color: #fff; font-weight: bold; margin-right: 14px;">3</div>
<div><strong style="color: #1e3a5f; font-size: 16px;">Manuscript Format</strong><br>Manuscripts should be prepared using Microsoft Word (.doc/.docx), A4 paper size, 10–20 pages, Times New Roman 12 pt, 1.15 line spacing, and must follow the official journal template.</div>
</div>
<!-- 4 -->
<div style="display: flex; align-items: flex-start; margin-bottom: 20px;">
<div style="min-width: 38px; height: 38px; background: linear-gradient(135deg,#1E3A5F,#4A90E2); border-radius: 50%; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; color: #fff; font-weight: bold; margin-right: 14px;">4</div>
<div><strong style="color: #1e3a5f; font-size: 16px;">References</strong><br>References should be managed using <strong>Mendeley</strong>, <strong>Zotero</strong>, or similar reference management software, following the <strong>APA Style 7th Edition.</strong> Authors are encouraged to cite recent scholarly publications, especially those published within the last five years.</div>
</div>
<!-- 5 -->
<div style="display: flex; align-items: flex-start; margin-bottom: 20px;">
<div style="min-width: 38px; height: 38px; background: linear-gradient(135deg,#1E3A5F,#4A90E2); border-radius: 50%; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; color: #fff; font-weight: bold; margin-right: 14px;">5</div>
<div><strong style="color: #1e3a5f; font-size: 16px;">Peer Review Process</strong><br>Every submission undergoes editorial screening, plagiarism checking, and a <strong>Double-Blind Peer Review</strong> process conducted by qualified reviewers before publication.</div>
</div>
</div>
<!-- PLAGIARISM -->
<div style="margin-top: 28px; background: linear-gradient(135deg,#EDF8FF,#D9F1FA); padding: 20px; border-left: 6px solid #4A90E2; border-radius: 10px;">
<div style="font-size: 17px; font-weight: bold; color: #1e3a5f; margin-bottom: 10px;">⚠️ Plagiarism Policy</div>
<p style="margin: 0; text-align: justify;">All manuscripts will be screened using plagiarism detection software (Turnitin or equivalent). The acceptable <strong>Similarity Index</strong> is <strong>20%</strong>, excluding references and properly cited quotations. Manuscripts exceeding this limit will be returned to the author for revision before entering the review process.</p>
